      "kind": "root_cause_line"
    },
    {
      "file": "common/x86/ihevc_sao_ssse3_intr.c",
      "function": "ihevc_sao_edge_offset_class2_ssse3",
      "line": null,
      "code": "sao_offset_8x16b = _mm_loadl_epi64((__m128i *)pi1_sao_offset);",
      "note": "The saved MSan report later surfaces the poison at `common/x86/ihevc_sao_ssse3_intr.c:2743` and `decoder/ihevcd_fmt_conv.c:202`, but those downstream frames are not needed once this earlier full-width load is used as the scored sink.",
